  "solution": {
    "text": "Let required circle be<br > <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br >Differentiation<br > <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br > <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>        ...(i)<br >Again differentiation<br > <math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>     ...(ii)<br >Putting value of g in equation (ii),<br > <math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br >So,  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br >i.e.,  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
